style.fill: "#17181b"
*.style: { font-size: 20; bold: false; fill: "#23252a"; stroke: "#747a85"; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; border-radius: 6 }
(* -> *)[*].style: { stroke: "#ff9b55"; stroke-width: 2; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; font-size: 16 }
grid-rows: 2
grid-columns: 3
horizontal-gap: 96
vertical-gap: 100
intent: Your decision\nChoose the useful outcome { shape: document }
ready: Get Ready\nAuthorised workspace\nPrivate evidence stays local
brief: Init\nEditable portable brief\nData, not credentials { shape: document }
public: Public site\nUse published HTTPS routes
cloud: Your Cloudflare account\nApp Workers + owned D1 / R2
source: Your repository\nAgent implements and tests\nExact source stays yours { shape: package }
intent -> ready: authorise
ready -> brief: checked
brief -> source: brief
source -> cloud: guarded\nrelease
cloud -> public: HTTPS
